{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Puzzle Party for 2-8 Players.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PiPu Party is a party game where you control the level itself. The goal is simple: get the note to the staff. But with a shared backpack of powerful symbols, every round is a fight for control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078600/extras/05235db2e07986ac6c56c16e0acbc60b.poster.avif?t=1764255997\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078600/extras/05235db2e07986ac6c56c16e0acbc60b.webm?t=1764255997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078600/extras/05235db2e07986ac6c56c16e0acbc60b.mp4?t=1764255997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shared Bag. Shared Chaos.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Puzzles (2 Players):</strong> Team up and combine your wits to solve challenging stages. Communication is key!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078600/extras/9bc82010817636af4037d23f5672861c.poster.avif?t=1764255997\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078600/extras/9bc82010817636af4037d23f5672861c.webm?t=1764255997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078600/extras/9bc82010817636af4037d23f5672861c.mp4?t=1764255997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work Together. Or Don't.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive Chaos (2-8 Players):</strong> Race to the goal by any means necessary.